    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d557">

                <pb facs="0774" n="672" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg672"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/1778: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-10-12T17:00:00+02:35">October 12, 1935—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 13—6:12 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>126. My 125, October 12, noon. Italian Minister has just been removed from his
                    Legation and is being held virtually a prisoner by the Ethiopian Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
